==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Sanke Carp}}
Sanke Carp are a type of [[Fish]] found exclusively at the base of the [[Lantern Falls]] in [[Kakariko Village]]. They are a subspecies of [[Armored Carp]] that do not provide any special effects when [[Cooking|Cooked]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> When consumed, Sanke Carp restore one of [[Link]]'s [[Heart]]s to his [[Life Gauge]] each. When exposed to [[Fire]], Sanke Carp become [[Roasted Carp]]s, while they can be chilled by [[Ice]] to make [[Frozen Carp]].

