{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Sanke Carp}}
{{Stub|TotK}}
Sanke Carp return in {{TotK}}, possessing the same properties as they did in {{BotW}}. In addition to spawning at the base of [[Lantern Falls]], one Sanke Carp can be found in each [[Garden Pond]] when included in [[Link's House]]. Unlike other [[Material]]s and [[Animal]]s, the Sanke Carp found in Garden Ponds will be respawned by [[Blood Moon]]s if taken.

